00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:29.076
We doing it on that one

00:00:29.076 --> 00:00:29.909
or are we doing this sand pit as well?

00:00:29.909 --> 00:00:30.742
We're doing both.

00:00:30.742 --> 00:00:31.575
Take one.

00:01:45.915 --> 00:01:47.787
Right well, I better give this a go then.

00:01:47.787 --> 00:01:48.890
I think so.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.290
