00:02:36.006 --> 00:02:36.839
I'm not going to try this one.

00:02:36.839 --> 00:02:37.930
I think you should.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:39.710
Cause I like my neck.

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:40.543
Go for it.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:14.940
Jack, I think we should give it one

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:18.160
