00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:18.993
What do you reckon?

00:03:18.993 --> 00:03:19.826
Yeah?

00:03:19.826 --> 00:03:20.670
All right, let's do it.

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:25.597
Oh, I landed on my feet.

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.143
